{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "744d40588e929b106181cf19c418972bd5474c0bc5c7e5840adfad6dffafa0f3", "ja": "（ドラマの撮影は順調だ。昼休憩になったから、\nロケ弁を渡したいんだけど……昴はどこだ？）", "zh": "（电视剧拍摄进行得很顺利。午休时间到了，我正想把剧组便当发给大家……昴去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "518b709095db2f3e94f0595efee5bfa4cc6c9e5a66243544e51bfdc313507239", "ja": "いいかー？　このニオイを覚えるんだぞ？\nよーしよし、それじゃ……取ってこーいっ！", "zh": "听好了哦？记住这个味道了吗？\n乖——乖，那么……去捡回来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1002_inu", "source_sha256": "51ded9b0f51c32e6942c4cbab1a838cbccd35ebd75beac40d2c50c0a3efeed22", "ja": "ワンワン♪", "zh": "汪汪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "480a50af19cc99a210bc6bfb63af55e19e452e5eaa36fc475d9c8a3baccb4c42", "ja": "昴、ここに居たのか。探したよ。", "zh": "昴，你在这儿啊。我找你找了好久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "3fe1c50f28839c9a1cb735a30a335f9681a2990a056a02ddcae248f323b3a342", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}、お疲れー！\nえへへ、コタローと一緒に遊んでたんだ！　なー♪", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，辛苦啦——！\n嘿嘿，我刚才在和小太郎一起玩呢！对吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1005_kotaro", "source_sha256": "f7a6eca051babec0be66b207fbc7e84717139d7fe635037a2eab9fbe346bdf96", "ja": "ワンッ！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "4178979a86d0b527da24891dbecbd7c2cb0ef61d6ed1f5ae657d17301e3ad5de", "ja": "こいつ、いつも寂しそうな顔しててさ……。\nなんだか放っておけなくて。", "zh": "这家伙总是一副寂寞的表情……\n不知怎么的，就是没法放着不管。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ee109f7587898addab3b647caa2666c1d4364da417184932b58e4193c7e73fb1", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nしかし随分、仲良くなったみたいだな？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n不过，你们好像已经变得很要好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "9df5523f000065fbff535471578217b8dba07dd8dc65fabf11eba870640806d2", "ja": "うん！　うちって、みんな忙しいだろ？\n面倒みれないから、動物が飼えないんだよ。", "zh": "嗯！我们这边的人不是都很忙吗？\n因为没法照料，所以没办法养动物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "a882c3a1ddc28f86e571edbe7195e930e1918508f797c66db2fa369705d2c07c", "ja": "でもその分、友達ん家のペットとか、\n共演した動物とかと、いーっぱい遊んでやるんだー！", "zh": "不过相应地，我会和朋友家的宠物，还有一起演出的动物们，痛痛快快地玩个够——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c0b287b8b18ef7e8b9526e1be896e83f1db514b0831e69c7d0cd8b7cf42702c5", "ja": "そうか。コタローもかなり嬉しいみたいだぞ。\nやっぱり優しい人のことは、わかるんだろうな。", "zh": "这样啊。小太郎好像也非常开心。\n果然，动物也能感受到温柔的人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "ffd93d054c0ebe55c24c03a41767248760941b1c3acb72131b0e3c7cb03ff1ff", "ja": "え？　そ、そうかな～。えへへ……♪\nなあ、コタロー。オレのこと好き？", "zh": "诶？是、是这样吗～。嘿嘿……♪\n呐，小太郎，你喜欢我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1012_kotaro", "source_sha256": "2dcbb643170bd5e32cded9de33e7e0fbb82c704fd518897c10e6c34d26de065f", "ja": "ワンッ♪", "zh": "汪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "ee4e00f9b291bd65d7338a707fd04beda6094dc5cf48b3bf0f7f41f859e620a7", "ja": "あははっ、オレも大好きだってば♪\nそんじゃ、一緒にお昼食べようぜ！", "zh": "啊哈哈，我也最喜欢你了啦♪\n那我们一起吃午饭吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "21b2853e8554e14871bc3c66aab3b3788271451fe8e732843c740d81c5cc2228", "ja": "なあなあ、{$P$}！\n頼んでたもの、持ってきてくれた？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！\n我拜托你的东西，你带来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b70db1df8620477ed56892a926a656d3a2c10e1362904f043674c009db384d0d", "ja": "ああ、持ってきたよ。\n……はい、ロケ弁と、犬用のミルク。", "zh": "嗯，带来了。\n……给，这是外景便当，还有给狗喝的牛奶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "718d37819e3db2a4a0504ac0f66383299e016d805721b69aedbc861a6be22287", "ja": "サンキュ！　ほーらコタロー、ご飯だぞー！\nいっぱい飲んで、おっきくなれよ。", "zh": "谢谢！来，小太郎，吃饭啦！\n多喝点，快快长大啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "025c89ed3f6cac4078f2ef4bfe120c5ef5e880bdac38f3fc642fb04efbcd3c76", "ja": "こ、こら、オレの手は舐めなくていいって！\nへへっ。やっぱ犬って、かわいいよなー♪", "zh": "喂、喂，不用舔我的手啦！\n嘿嘿。狗狗果然很可爱啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f48bff7176153b6851044dd4d74cee046fdc5f664e877c5af71d663e305ee2ca", "ja": "そうだな。だけど、昴も弁当を食べないと。\n次のシーンに間に合わなくなるぞ？", "zh": "是啊。不过昴也得吃便当才行。\n不然就赶不上下一场了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "7a54b81e650327932b8bfae6628da6ff5c9bd9cb8257411e3ec7c2b50477940f", "ja": "いっけね！　次は喧嘩のシーンだったよな！\nちゃんと食べて、体力回復しておかないと！", "zh": "糟糕！接下来是吵架的戏份吧！得好好吃饭，先把体力恢复过来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3efb8333b8a1a4fa7ce9149fa740b8bfb1f2e36b1c6949a56b03608b446cb8b8", "ja": "（コタローとの休憩は、昴の気分転換になったようだ。\nその後の撮影でも、昴は絶好調だった！）", "zh": "（和小太郎一起休息似乎让昴转换了心情。之后的拍摄中，昴也一直状态绝佳！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "cbc3ed40ba71f0e9b6c2c1e58aca8f025588648b27e9f2958ac11251533ee05c", "ja": "オレは何度も忠告したはずだ！\n仲間に手ぇ出したら、タダじゃおかないって……。", "zh": "我应该已经警告过你很多次了吧！\n要是你敢对我的伙伴下手，我可不会轻饶你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "47f2bcd63c4e75cd61d88fe614953387e09271456d849ee23ee289981ec5eca3", "ja": "それでも手ぇ出してきたのは、そっちだ！\nなら、覚悟はできてんだよなー？　ああ！？", "zh": "即便如此，先动手的也是你们！\n既然这样，已经做好觉悟了吧——？啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "332279c3676d74fa0601d79e4bd2786c251c64656d74cac94be0458a8121f99c", "ja": "へへっ……腕が鳴るぜ！\n行くぜー！　おらぁぁぁ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……我的手臂已经跃跃欲试了！\n上吧——！喝啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0204_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6e38b19d85e2573bfa1620ac487681ff50a22285b6ff77daec40b8a5f14ceb61", "ja": "（仲間思いな不良の役、優しい昴にピッタリだったな。\nこれなら最後まで、いい演技を見せてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（这个重视同伴的不良少女角色，实在太适合温柔的昴了。\n这样一来，她一定能为我们演到最后，呈现出精彩的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
